// Title: Reg Mod Defender
// Description: Hunts for reg mod defender
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1562.001
// Severity: low
// FalsePositives:
//   - Software install/update yang sah memodifikasi registry.
RegistryEvents | where RegistryKey contains 'Windows Defender' and RegistryValueName == 'DisableAntiSpyware'
